{"2780650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Burden of Revenge", "steam_appid": 2780650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Burden of Revenge</strong> is a story-driven third-person action-adventure puzzle platformer set in the naturepunk wilderness of Tempelheim. Wield your father’s magitech Gauntlet, reclaim the ancient Everseeds, and hunt the creature blamed for his death. As your quest for revenge unfolds, you'll uncover a buried history that challenges everything you believe and reveals the truth behind your father's legacy.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/b68f8253d8a318a6b62648f53dfdf0f3.avif?t=1785853047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras_big/b68f8253d8a318a6b62648f53dfdf0f3.webp?t=1785853047 width=1560 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across six major hand-crafted regions where vibrant magical nature collides with the ruins of a decaying magitech empire. Climb ancient temples, cross poisonous flower valleys, explore drowned ruins, and uncover the secrets buried throughout Tempelheim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/a47bd8693c07bfd671175d3b5179e890.poster.avif?t=1785853047\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/a47bd8693c07bfd671175d3b5179e890.webm?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/a47bd8693c07bfd671175d3b5179e890.mp4?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/2ca1e73c2116a21db64617db8cb83d4a.avif?t=1785853047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras_big/2ca1e73c2116a21db64617db8cb83d4a.webp?t=1785853047 width=1560 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, grapple, climb, and fight your way through environments built around fluid traversal. Combine magical abilities with ancient mechanisms, movable objects, hidden paths, and timing-based challenges as platforming, combat, and environmental puzzling flow into one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/a33a5b81bdfcd984528b3085c3866123.poster.avif?t=1785853047\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/a33a5b81bdfcd984528b3085c3866123.webm?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/a33a5b81bdfcd984528b3085c3866123.mp4?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/dfbcbc1f88d6c9c47cf400a0b4a78d55.avif?t=1785853047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras_big/dfbcbc1f88d6c9c47cf400a0b4a78d55.webp?t=1785853047 width=1560 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb the power of four Everseeds: Verdantis, Florsica, Hydrielle, and Mycellix, and switch between their abilities to manipulate nature, cross impossible terrain, solve layered puzzles, and overcome your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/5b1ca2c60c090badcf4a7b84fbf95a7c.poster.avif?t=1785853047\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/5b1ca2c60c090badcf4a7b84fbf95a7c.webm?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/5b1ca2c60c090badcf4a7b84fbf95a7c.mp4?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/bf603cacb9602d078635cfb784e7c086.avif?t=1785853047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras_big/bf603cacb9602d078635cfb784e7c086.webp?t=1785853047 width=1560 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle dangerous creatures and towering Temple Guardians in fast-paced encounters built around movement, timing, and mastery of the Gauntlet. Follow Finn’s hunt for his father’s killer as buried truths challenge everything he believes about his father, his enemies, and himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/95994ec14551117d117292469ef17509.poster.avif?t=1785853047\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/95994ec14551117d117292469ef17509.webm?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/95994ec14551117d117292469ef17509.mp4?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Burden of Revenge</strong> is a story-driven third-person action-adventure puzzle platformer set in the naturepunk wilderness of Tempelheim. Wield your father’s magitech Gauntlet, reclaim the ancient Everseeds, and hunt the creature blamed for his death. As your quest for revenge unfolds, you'll uncover a buried history that challenges everything you believe and reveals the truth behind your father's legacy.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/b68f8253d8a318a6b62648f53dfdf0f3.avif?t=1785853047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras_big/b68f8253d8a318a6b62648f53dfdf0f3.webp?t=1785853047 width=1560 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across six major hand-crafted regions where vibrant magical nature collides with the ruins of a decaying magitech empire. Climb ancient temples, cross poisonous flower valleys, explore drowned ruins, and uncover the secrets buried throughout Tempelheim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/a47bd8693c07bfd671175d3b5179e890.poster.avif?t=1785853047\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/a47bd8693c07bfd671175d3b5179e890.webm?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/a47bd8693c07bfd671175d3b5179e890.mp4?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=