g\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/5b1ca2c60c090badcf4a7b84fbf95a7c.poster.avif?t=1785853047\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/5b1ca2c60c090badcf4a7b84fbf95a7c.webm?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/5b1ca2c60c090badcf4a7b84fbf95a7c.mp4?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/bf603cacb9602d078635cfb784e7c086.avif?t=1785853047\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras_big/bf603cacb9602d078635cfb784e7c086.webp?t=1785853047 width=1560 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle dangerous creatures and towering Temple Guardians in fast-paced encounters built around movement, timing, and mastery of the Gauntlet. Follow Finn’s hunt for his father’s killer as buried truths challenge everything he believes about his father, his enemies, and himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/95994ec14551117d117292469ef17509.poster.avif?t=1785853047\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/95994ec14551117d117292469ef17509.webm?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780650/extras/95994ec14551117d117292469ef17509.mp4?t=1785853047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Step 